{"seq":3,"slug":"over-optimization","title":"过度优化：Goodhart 定律的量化曲线与 KL 缰绳","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reward-modeling-rlhf/challenges/over-optimization","wordCount":1674,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"过度优化-goodhart-定律的量化曲线与-kl-缰绳\">过度优化：Goodhart 定律的量化曲线与 KL 缰绳</h1><p><a href=\"reward-hacking\">奖励黑客</a> 告诉你策略会钻代理奖励的空子，但它是定性的现象学。真到了工程现场，你需要定量的答案：策略优化到什么程度就该刹车？给多少 KL 预算才不翻车？奖励模型做多大能撑住多强的策略？过度优化（over-optimization）就是把奖励黑客从&quot;会发生&quot;升级成&quot;如何随优化预算演化&quot;的动力学，并给出可操作的控制杠杆。这一篇讲那条著名的先涨后跌曲线、量化它的规模定律、以及用 KL 惩罚当缰绳的完整逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-代理奖励涨-真实奖励先涨后跌\">核心概念：代理奖励涨、真实奖励先涨后跌</h2><p>过度优化最核心的图像来自 Gao、Schulman、Hilton 2022 年的规模定律研究（arXiv:2210.10760），后被无数团队复现。当你不断增加对代理奖励的优化强度（横轴常用策略偏离初始模型的 KL 散度），代理奖励（奖励模型给的分）会持续单调上升；但真实奖励（用一个更大的&quot;金标&quot;奖励模型或人类衡量）会先跟着涨、到某个点后<strong>掉头下跌</strong>。那个拐点就是过度优化的临界。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[优化强度增加&lt;br/&gt;KL 散度增大] --&gt; B[代理奖励 r_theta]&#10;    A --&gt; C[真实奖励 r_star]&#10;    B --&gt; D[单调持续上升]&#10;    C --&gt; E[先上升]&#10;    E --&gt; F{越过拐点?}&#10;    F --&gt;|否| G[真实奖励仍涨&lt;br/&gt;健康优化]&#10;    F --&gt;|是| H[真实奖励下跌&lt;br/&gt;过度优化]&#10;    D -.差距扩大.-&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[策略变好看不变好用]\">flowchart TD\n    A[优化强度增加&lt;br/&gt;KL 散度增大] --&gt; B[代理奖励 r_theta]\n    A --&gt; C[真实奖励 r_star]\n    B --&gt; D[单调持续上升]\n    C --&gt; E[先上升]\n    E --&gt; F{越过拐点?}\n    F --&gt;|否| G[真实奖励仍涨&lt;br/&gt;健康优化]\n    F --&gt;|是| H[真实奖励下跌&lt;br/&gt;过度优化]\n    D -.差距扩大.-&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[策略变好看不变好用]</pre><p>图里那条&quot;代理涨、真实跌&quot;的剪刀差就是 Goodhart 定律的量化身影。工程上的目标非常明确：<strong>在拐点之前停下</strong>，或者把拐点尽量往后推。难点在于，真实奖励在训练时通常看不见（你手里只有代理），所以拐点要靠间接手段预判。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规模定律-拐点可以被预测\">规模定律：拐点可以被预测</h2><p>Gao 等人的关键贡献不只是画出这条曲线，而是发现它服从可预测的<strong>函数形式</strong>。真实奖励作为 KL 散度的函数，大致符合形如下式的规律：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^*(d) = d \\cdot (\\alpha - \\beta \\log d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 是策略偏离初始模型的 KL 散度的平方根，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 是拟合系数。这个式子的意义在于：拐点（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的最大值处）的位置可以从早期训练数据外推预测，不必真的跑到崩溃才知道该停。更重要的两条推论：其一，<strong>奖励模型越大、训练数据越多，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 越小，拐点越靠后</strong>——这就是 <a href=\"../training/reward-architecture\">奖励模型架构</a> 里&quot;奖励模型不必比策略小、更大更抗造&quot;那条经验的理论出处；其二，过度优化对 KL 距离的依赖比对训练步数更本质，这直接把 KL 推上了控制杠杆的核心位置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"kl-惩罚-拴住策略的缰绳\">KL 惩罚：拴住策略的缰绳</h2><p>既然过度优化本质上是策略在 KL 空间里跑太远，最直接的控制就是在优化目标里加一个 KL 惩罚，惩罚策略 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 偏离初始参考模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_{\\text{ref}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>目标</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>KL</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{目标} = \\mathbb{E}_{y \\sim \\pi}\\big[r_\\theta(y)\\big] - \\beta \\cdot D_{\\text{KL}}\\big(\\pi \\,\\|\\, \\pi_{\\text{ref}}\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">目标</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∼</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">KL</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 就是缰绳的松紧：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 大，策略被死死拴在参考模型附近，安全但学不到东西；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 小，策略自由奔跑，容易冲过拐点被 hack。调 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 是 RLHF 里最重要也最玄学的超参之一。这个 KL 项不是本 hub 发明的——它是 PPO 目标里的标准组件，完整推导与实现在 <a href=\"../../reinforcement-learning/policy-based-methods/ppo-and-trpo\">14 号强化学习的 PPO 篇</a> 与 <a href=\"../../rlhf-preference-alignment/reward-modeling/rlhf-ppo\">54 号 RLHF-PPO 篇</a>。本 hub 关心的是：它正是控制奖励模型这个代理被优化到何种程度的闸门。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缓解手段</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>KL 惩罚（调大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>限制策略偏离参考模型</td>\n<td>学习受限、对齐不充分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更大/更多数据的奖励模型</td>\n<td>把拐点往后推</td>\n<td>训练与推理成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>奖励集成 + 保守奖励</td>\n<td>惩罚高不确定区</td>\n<td>多模型成本（见校准篇）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>早停</td>\n<td>在拐点前停止</td>\n<td>需预判拐点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迭代式重训奖励模型</td>\n<td>在新策略分布上补标</td>\n<td>需持续标注</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"迭代式对齐-不断给奖励模型补课\">迭代式对齐：不断给奖励模型补课</h2><p>过度优化有一个更根本的解法思路：既然问题出在策略跑到了奖励模型没见过的分布外，那就<strong>别让它长期分布外</strong>。做法是把 RLHF 变成迭代循环——训一段 RL、拿当前策略生成新回答、对这些新回答重新标注偏好、用新数据更新奖励模型、再训一段 RL。每一轮奖励模型都在当前策略的分布上被&quot;补课&quot;，拐点被反复往后推。这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/why-reward-modeling\">为何奖励建模</a> 里那条&quot;采新样本回流&quot;虚线的深层用意，也是现代对齐流水线（如 Llama、Tulu 3 等开放后训练工作）普遍采用多轮迭代的原因。代价是每轮都要新标注，成本高，但它把过度优化从&quot;一次性灾难&quot;变成了&quot;可持续管理的慢性病&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与可验证奖励的关系\">与可验证奖励的关系</h2><p>一个绕过整套 KL 博弈的思路：如果奖励根本不是学出来的代理，而是真值本身呢？对可验证任务用 RLVR（跑单测、比答案），奖励就不再是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的近似而近乎 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 本身，过度优化的经典剪刀差随之大幅缓解——你没法&quot;过度优化&quot;一个真正判定对错的验证器（至少不像骗一个神经网络那么容易）。这是 2025 年推理模型大规模转向可验证奖励的深层动机之一。但要小心，验证器本身也可能有漏洞（比如单测覆盖不全），只是被 hack 的门槛高得多。可验证奖励的完整讨论在 <a href=\"../practice/process-outcome\">过程与结果奖励</a> 与 <a href=\"../practice/rm-free-methods\">免奖励模型方法</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>过度优化是奖励黑客的量化动力学：随优化强度增加，代理奖励单调涨、真实奖励先涨后跌，拐点即 Goodhart 临界。</li>\n<li>Gao 等人的规模定律给出真实奖励关于 KL 的可预测函数形式，拐点可外推，且奖励模型越大拐点越靠后。</li>\n<li>KL 惩罚（系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>）是拴住策略、防其冲过拐点的核心缰绳，是 PPO 目标的标准组件。</li>\n<li>迭代式对齐通过在新策略分布上反复重训奖励模型，把过度优化从一次性灾难变成可管理的慢性病。</li>\n<li>对可验证任务改用 RLVR，用近乎真值的奖励绕过经典剪刀差，是 2025 年推理模型转向的深层动机。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"reward-hacking\">奖励黑客</a> 是本篇量化的定性对应；<a href=\"calibration-uncertainty\">校准与不确定性</a> 提供保守奖励这一额外缰绳；<a href=\"../training/reward-architecture\">奖励模型架构</a> 解释为何更大的奖励模型推后拐点。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../reinforcement-learning/policy-based-methods/ppo-and-trpo\">14_reinforcement-learning / PPO 与 TRPO</a> 讲 KL 惩罚所在的优化算法；<a href=\"../../rlhf-preference-alignment/reward-modeling/rlhf-ppo\">54_rlhf-preference-alignment / RLHF-PPO</a> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 调参的工程语境。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"过度优化：Goodhart 定律的量化曲线与 KL 缰绳","id":"过度优化-goodhart-定律的量化曲线与-kl-缰绳"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：代理奖励涨、真实奖励先涨后跌","id":"核心概念-代理奖励涨-真实奖励先涨后跌"},{"level":2,"text":"规模定律：拐点可以被预测","id":"规模定律-拐点可以被预测"},{"level":2,"text":"KL 惩罚：拴住策略的缰绳","id":"kl-惩罚-拴住策略的缰绳"},{"level":2,"text":"迭代式对齐：不断给奖励模型补课","id":"迭代式对齐-不断给奖励模型补课"},{"level":2,"text":"与可验证奖励的关系","id":"与可验证奖励的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"校准与不确定性：让奖励模型知道自己何时不该自信","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reward-modeling-rlhf/challenges/calibration-uncertainty"},"next":{"title":"过程与结果奖励：给答案打分，还是给每一步打分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reward-modeling-rlhf/practice/process-outcome"}}